        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-027" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2021-03-01 · Telegram 5966, 5969&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #5966 · 2021-03-01T13:34:42:&lt;/b&gt; You are at the prime part already???&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #5969 · 2021-03-01T13:35:15:&lt;/b&gt; Oh wait, shouldn&amp;#x27;t have said that. That might have been a hint 🤔.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; “You are at the prime part already???” followed by “That might have been a hint.”&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Prime use is intended." vertex="1">
