        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-030" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2021-04-01 · Telegram 6884&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #6884 · 2021-04-01T09:57:38:&lt;/b&gt; Hint: &amp;quot;another door might be found on {1 },{4} ,{21}&amp;quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Formal hint: another door might be found on {1},{4},{21}.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Exact first-piece FEFE locator after reconstruction." vertex="1">
