        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-031" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2021-04-01 · Telegram 6913&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #6913 · 2021-04-01T16:29:41:&lt;/b&gt; R=18&lt;br&gt;A=1&lt;br&gt;B=2&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Could also be 21 or 1812 bit 🧐. Sometimes I&amp;#x27;m glad I don&amp;#x27;t have to solve this puzzle myself.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; R=18 / A=1 / B=2; “Could also be 21 or 1812 bit.”&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Supplies the R-A-B + BIT → RABBIT pointer and bit-grid framing." vertex="1">
