        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-033" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2021-04-18 · Telegram 7529&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Community parent #7528:&lt;/b&gt; Is this an actual hint we can use please?  I’m asking because it was mentioned on April 1st&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #7529 · 2021-04-18T21:24:13:&lt;/b&gt; Do you know what usually happens on the first of april?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Responds to “is the April 1 hint real?” by asking what usually happens on April 1.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Caveat: the date disguises the clue; this is not a clean yes/no confirmation by itself." vertex="1">
