        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-034" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2021-12-03 · Telegram 7914&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Community parent #7913:&lt;/b&gt; give a hint, pls, with the first day of winter 2021-2022 :) omikron collapse a time to solve.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #7914 · 2021-12-03T05:41:18:&lt;/b&gt; There is&lt;br&gt;Another&lt;br&gt;D&lt;br&gt;O&lt;br&gt;O&lt;br&gt;R&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Replies to a hint request with vertically emphasized “There is Another D O O R.”&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Reconfirms the extra-door branch." vertex="1">
