        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-035" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2021-12-26 · Telegram 8000&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #8000 · 2021-12-26T22:18:32:&lt;/b&gt; The previous &amp;quot;there is another door hint&amp;quot; is still a thing. We&amp;#x27;re not sure if anyone has found another door so far, and we can&amp;#x27;t check that... We&amp;#x27;ve seen prime numbers being mentioned; well, that is definitely an aspect which is required to proceed. Furthermore, along the way, some characters need to be &amp;#x27;zeroed out&amp;#x27;.. Best of luck and happy holidays! 🥂&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Formal mini-hint: another door remains relevant, primes are required, and some characters must be “zeroed out.”&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Strongest creator description of the unresolved operation; plural characters remain important." vertex="1">
