        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-042" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2023-01-12 · Telegram 8360&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #8360 · 2023-01-12T13:15:46:&lt;/b&gt; Just be clear. My apologies for this puzzle not to be too easy. I&amp;#x27;m aware it might appear unsolvable, but it&amp;#x27;s not. If you find the answer now, the remaining 2.5 btc is well deserved... Or 5, who knows.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Says the puzzle is solvable and the remaining BTC is deserved.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Solvability/prize meta only." vertex="1">
