        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-045" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2023-08-03 · Telegram 8795, 8796&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Community parent #8791:&lt;/b&gt; But you can confirm if there is indeed a 3rd door that is yet to be found right?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #8795 · 2023-08-03T23:33:50:&lt;/b&gt; I saw that you guys got really really far already.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #8796 · 2023-08-03T23:34:24:&lt;/b&gt; Actually, the hardest part is done.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Says solvers got “really really far” and “the hardest part is done.”&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Strong progress signal, but not a method confirmation." vertex="1">
