        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-046" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2023-08-06 · Telegram 9599&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #9599 · 2023-08-06T15:12:13:&lt;/b&gt; Probably the last hint:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Once you hit a &amp;quot;ying yang&amp;quot;, you&amp;#x27;ll be able to solve it the same day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; “Probably the last hint”: once a “ying yang” is hit, the puzzle can be solved the same day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Yin-yang is a reached state/phase, not automatically a literal password." vertex="1">
