        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-048" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2023-08-06 · Telegram 9607&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Community parent #9605:&lt;/b&gt; @SoWut any chance you can tell us if there is another URL to find? otherwise I am going to do a big brute force haha&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #9607 · 2023-08-06T15:19:07:&lt;/b&gt; No need. You have all the info.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Rejects the need for another URL: “You have all the info.”&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Search-boundary guidance against inventing external dependencies." vertex="1">
