        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-049" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2023-08-06 · Telegram 9615&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Community parent #9609:&lt;/b&gt; I&amp;#x27;ve been lurking for years recharging, finally want to get back in and solve this&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #9615 · 2023-08-06T15:21:07:&lt;/b&gt; My hat off to you, and you know why 🫡.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; “My hat off to you, and you know why.”&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Private/contextual praise; unusable as public method confirmation." vertex="1">
