        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-050" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2023-08-06 · Telegram 9621&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Community parent #9616:&lt;/b&gt; Only fair ones. And to everyone.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #9621 · 2023-08-06T15:43:54:&lt;/b&gt; To answer your question &amp;#x27;fully&amp;#x27;, from here on, high likely no hints anymore. But if somehow you all can&amp;#x27;t solve it from here in the next few years (which I deem unlikely given the state of the solving process), then I might feel the need to give an additional hint, as I couldn&amp;#x27;t happily live with the idea that some would think that this was a scam. Note, that I hope not to have to give another hint as it would probably be a give away. Good luck to you all!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Says another hint would probably be a giveaway and likely is unnecessary.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Solvability/meta only." vertex="1">
