        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-051" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2023-08-06 · Telegram 9627&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Community parent #9626:&lt;/b&gt; unless Jrk thinks we already know something, which we do not&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #9627 · 2023-08-06T15:49:59:&lt;/b&gt; Something was solved rather... remarkable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; “Something was solved rather... remarkable.”&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Progress signal without identifying which public claim is correct." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="177" width="1860" x="20" y="11791" as="geometry" />
