        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-052" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2023-08-06 · Telegram 9639&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #9639 · 2023-08-06T21:39:34:&lt;/b&gt; Correct. Well, technically, you&amp;#x27;ll need the internet to claim the prize in the end 🤔.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Confirms no internet is needed for solving, except ultimately claiming the prize.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Supports a self-contained solution." vertex="1">
