        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-053" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2023-08-29 · Telegram 12653&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Community parent #12580:&lt;/b&gt; Jrk has stated that the blockchain messages are not his and are not part of the puzzle&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #12653 · 2023-08-29T21:06:07:&lt;/b&gt; Correct&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Replies Correct to the claim that blockchain messages were not his and are not part of the puzzle.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Closes those messages as creator clues." vertex="1">
