        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-054" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2024-01-26 · Telegram 20223&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Community parent #20221:&lt;/b&gt; Please say me what format key we are all searching? Answer only this question, maybe PM.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #20223 · 2024-01-26T19:21:46:&lt;/b&gt; Regular Bitcoin Private key&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Says the target is a regular Bitcoin private key.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Confirms output format only." vertex="1">
