        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-055" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2024-01-26 · Telegram 20224&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Community parent #20222:&lt;/b&gt; I&amp;#x27;ve been banging my head against a wall due to an inability to solve &amp;quot;our first hint is your last command&amp;quot;. That seems to be the 2nd to last piece we need to solve in Salph. Annnnnny chance you can give the community a tiny hint to get over the line with that one?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #20224 · 2024-01-26T19:22:04:&lt;/b&gt; 🤐&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Replies 🤐 to a request for help with “our first hint is your last command.”&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Silence, not confirmation of the requester’s interpretation." vertex="1">
