        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-060" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2026-03-04 · Telegram 60309&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Community parent #60308:&lt;/b&gt; we can&amp;#x27;t proceed further and i believe we have been wasted years to prove it. idk what are u expect from us but you need to hint us about the direction.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #60309 · 2026-03-04T03:27:00:&lt;/b&gt; Looks at gnomad. 👀&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Responds to a demand for direction by pointing at gnomad.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Sets up the following confirmation." vertex="1">
