        <mxCell id="creator-evidence-card-067" parent="creator-evidence-lane" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2026-07-13 · Telegram 66584&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Source:&lt;/i&gt; GSMG Puzzle Solvers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Creator #66584 · 2026-07-13T03:55:29:&lt;/b&gt; Welcome. I feel it a bit off knowing the url (and thus the original puzzle) is &amp;quot;gone&amp;quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indexed evidence:&lt;/b&gt; Notes the original URL/puzzle is “gone.”&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meaning / limit:&lt;/b&gt; Historical-status statement." vertex="1">
